cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Transducin — Multivendor OCT to DICOM Pipeline for RetinaOS
message: >-
  If you make use of this software, please cite it
  using the metadata from this file.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Jesús Noel
    family-names: Jaurrieta Hinojos
    affiliation: RetinaOS / oftalmos-org
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9240-0049"
version: 1.0.0
abstract: >-
  Multivendor OCT to DICOM conversion pipeline supporting
  Optopol Revo FC130 and Carl Zeiss Meditec Cirrus devices.
  Extracts macular thickness (CMT, ETDRS 9-sector), mRNFL,
  mGCIPL, peripapillary RNFL (3.4 mm ring, S/I/N/T sectors
  via DMARKERS disc centre), optic disc metrics (C/D ratio,
  VCDR, disc area, rim area, cup volume), and biometric
  measurements (AL, CCT, K1/K2). Generates DICOM Structured
  Reports (TID 1500/1501) with full anatomic context and
  routes them to Orthanc PACS via C-STORE.
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: 'https://github.com/oftalmos-org/transducin'

references:
